---
// HowItWorks.astro — Lovable bento card style
---

<section class="hiw-section" id="how-it-works" aria-labelledby="hiw-heading">
  <div class="container">

    <div class="section-header">
      <p class="mono-eyebrow">How It Works</p>
      <h2 class="heading-lg" id="hiw-heading">The Exact KB Ceiling, Explained</h2>
      <p class="body-lg">
        A deterministic three-phase pipeline runs entirely in your browser — no network round-trips, no waiting.
      </p>
    </div>

    <ol class="bento-grid" role="list" aria-label="Compression steps">

      <li class="bento-card">
        <div class="bento-inner">
          <div class="bento-step-badge">
            <span class="mono-eyebrow">01</span>
          </div>
          <div class="bento-icon" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"
              stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3"/>
              <path d="M12 1v4M12 19v4M4.93 4.93l1.41 1.41M17.66 17.66l1.41 1.41M1 12h4M19 12h4M4.22 19.78l2.83-2.83M16.95 7.05l2.83-2.83"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="bento-title">Select Your Target</h3>
          <p class="bento-desc">
            Choose a preset (20 KB, 50 KB, 100 KB) or set a custom ceiling.
            The engine guarantees output in <strong>[target × 0.95, target × 0.98]</strong> —
            for 20 KB, that's 19.0–19.6 KB.
          </p>
          <div class="bento-detail">
            <span class="mono-eyebrow">Target → [KB × 0.95, KB × 0.98]</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </li>

      <li class="bento-card bento-card--featured">
        <div class="bento-inner">
          <div class="bento-step-badge">
            <span class="mono-eyebrow">02</span>
          </div>
          <div class="bento-icon" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"
              stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <polyline points="22 12 18 12 15 21 9 3 6 12 2 12"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="bento-title">Binary In-Memory Optimization</h3>
          <p class="bento-desc">
            Proportional downscaling via ≤2× halving steps on OffscreenCanvas preserves
            edge contrast. Then binary search over JPEG quality (0.01–0.99) converges
            in 10–12 iterations — no brute force, no uploads.
          </p>
          <div class="bento-detail">
            <span class="mono-eyebrow">≤12 iterations · Zero server round-trips</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </li>

      <li class="bento-card">
        <div class="bento-inner">
          <div class="bento-step-badge">
            <span class="mono-eyebrow">03</span>
          </div>
          <div class="bento-icon" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"
              stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <path d="M21 15v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-4"/>
              <polyline points="7 10 12 15 17 10"/>
              <line x1="12" y1="15" x2="12" y2="3"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="bento-title">Portal-Ready Download</h3>
          <p class="bento-desc">
            Your compressed file downloads instantly from browser memory.
            Standard JPEG accepted by SSC, UPSC, NSDL PAN, and most
            State exam portals — exact byte size shown before download.
          </p>
          <div class="bento-detail">
            <span class="mono-eyebrow">Standard JPEG · Exact size before download</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </li>

    </ol>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .hiw-section {
    padding: 80px 0;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }

  .section-header {
    max-width: 580px;
    margin-bottom: 40px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 12px;
  }

  .section-header .body-lg { color: var(--color-text-muted); }

  /* Bento grid */
  .bento-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 12px;
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
  }

  .bento-card {
    background-color: var(--color-cream-card);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: 14px;
    overflow: hidden;
    transition: border-color 0.2s ease;
  }
  .bento-card:hover { border-color: rgba(28,28,28,0.25); }
  [data-theme="dark"] .bento-card:hover { border-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.15); }

  /* Featured center card — slightly elevated background */
  .bento-card--featured {
    background-color: var(--color-cream);
    border-color: rgba(28,28,28,0.12);
  }
  [data-theme="dark"] .bento-card--featured {
    background-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.03);
    border-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.12);
  }

  .bento-inner {
    padding: 24px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 12px;
    height: 100%;
  }

  /* Step badge */
  .bento-step-badge {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
  }

  /* Icon */
  .bento-icon {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    width: 40px;
    height: 40px;
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    background-color: var(--color-cream);
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
  }
  [data-theme="dark"] .bento-icon {
    background-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.04);
  }

  .bento-title {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 16px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: -0.3px;
    color: var(--color-text);
    line-height: 1.3;
  }

  .bento-desc {
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    flex: 1;
  }

  .bento-desc strong { color: var(--color-text); font-weight: 600; }

  .bento-detail {
    padding-top: 12px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }

  .bento-detail .mono-eyebrow { color: var(--color-text-muted); }

  @media (max-width: 900px) { .bento-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
  @media (min-width: 600px) and (max-width: 900px) {
    .bento-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
  }
</style>
